<title>POLAND: Polish '96 sugar beet output up to 16.5-17.3 mln T.</title>
<headline>Polish '96 sugar beet output up to 16.5-17.3 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish sugar beet output in 1996 rose to between 16.50 and 17.30 million tonnes from last year's 13.31 million, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>On August 2, GUS said sugar beet output this year would likely rise to around 15.5 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
